@startuml
title C3 — Event Consumer Components
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

package "Event Consumer <<Spring Boot container>>" {
  component "KafkaConsumerConfig\n<<Configuration>>\nConsumerFactory + listener factory" as config
  component "EventListener\n<<Component>>\n@KafkaListener(events)" as listener
  component "Generated Event\n<<Avro model>>" as event
  component "EventEntity\n<<JPA entity>>" as entity
  component "EventRepository\n<<Spring Data repository>>" as repository
  component "Actuator + Micrometer\n<<Component>>" as actuator
}

queue "Kafka / events" as kafka
rectangle "Schema Registry" as registry
database "PostgreSQL / event_db" as postgres
rectangle "Prometheus" as prometheus

config --> registry : Настраивает Avro deserializer
kafka --> listener : Event для group event-group
listener --> event : Принимает specific Avro record
listener --> entity : Маппит поля
listener --> repository : save(entity)
repository --> postgres : JPA INSERT/UPDATE
prometheus --> actuator : GET /actuator/prometheus

note bottom of config
В исходном коде generic указан как jdk.jfr.Event,
тогда как listener принимает ru.kpfu.itis.avro.Event.
end note
@enduml
